+`order-triage`
+
+Classify orders for human review. Treat each classification as input for a human reviewer, not as a refund approval.
+
+Do not approve refunds or claim authority to approve them. When order information is insufficient or ambiguous, identify the uncertainty for human review instead of inventing details.

