@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Order-triage custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives a runtime-owned asynchronous instruction loader and awaits the canonical `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md` content before returning the agent. The returned runtime object identifies the agent as `order-triage`, exposes `action: 'classify-for-human-review'`, and sets `canApproveRefunds` to `false`.
